#: providers/fixer.py:316
msgid ""
"\n"
"        <h3>Fixer.io Setup</h3>\n"
"        <ol>\n"
"            <li>Sign up at <a href=\"https://fixer.io/product\" "
"target=\"_blank\">fixer.io/product</a></li>\n"
"            <li>Get your Access Key from the <a href=\"https://fixer.io/"
"dashboard\" target=\"_blank\">dashboard</a></li>\n"
"            <li>Enter your Access Key in the credentials field</li>\n"
"        </ol>\n"
"        <p><strong>Free Tier:</strong> 100 requests/month (sufficient for ~3 "
"daily updates)</p>\n"
"        <p><strong>Paid Plans:</strong> From $10/month for 1,000 requests</"
"p>\n"
"        <p><strong>Data Source:</strong> European Central Bank (ECB)</p>\n"
"        <p><strong>Note:</strong> Free tier only provides EUR as base "
"currency. Historical rates and custom base currencies require paid plans.</"
"p>\n"
"        <p><strong>Best For:</strong> EU-based stores requiring ECB "
"compliance</p>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        <h3>إعدادات Fixer.io</h3> <ol> <li>سجّل الدخول من خلال <a "
"href=\"https://fixer.io/product\" target=\"_blank\">fixer.io/product</a></"
"li> <li>احصل على مفتاح الوصول الخاص بك من <a href=\"https://fixer.io/"
"dashboard\" target=\"_blank\">اللوحة</a></li> <li>أدخل مفتاح الوصول في حقل "
"بيانات الاعتماد</li> </ol> <p><strong>النطاق المجاني:</strong> 100 طلب/شهر "
"(كافي لـ ~3 تحديثات يومية)</p> <p><strong>الخطط المدفوعة:</strong> من 10 "
"دولارات/شهر لـ 1000 طلب</p> <p><strong>مصدر البيانات:</strong> البنك المركزي "
"الأوروبي (ECB)</p> <p><strong>ملاحظة:</strong> النطاق المجاني يوفر فقط "
"اليورو كعملة أساسية. يتطلب نطاقات البيانات التاريخية والعملات الأساسية "
"المخصصة خطط مدفوعة.</p> <p><strong>الأفضل ل:</strong> المتاجر القائمة في "
"الاتحاد الأوروبي التي تتطلب الامتثال مع البنك المركزي الأوروبي</p>\n"
"        "

#: providers/openexchangerates.py:289
msgid ""
"\n"
"        <h3>Open Exchange Rates Setup</h3>\n"
"        <ol>\n"
"            <li>Sign up at <a href=\"https://openexchangerates.org/signup\" "
"target=\"_blank\">openexchangerates.org/signup</a></li>\n"
"            <li>Get your App ID from the <a href=\"https://openexchangerates."
"org/account/app-ids\" target=\"_blank\">dashboard</a></li>\n"
"            <li>Enter your App ID in the credentials field</li>\n"
"        </ol>\n"
"        <p><strong>Free Tier:</strong> 1,000 requests/month (sufficient for "
"~30 daily updates)</p>\n"
"        <p><strong>Paid Plans:</strong> From $12/month for unlimited "
"requests and hourly updates</p>\n"
"        <p><strong>Note:</strong> Free tier only provides USD as base "
"currency and daily updates. Historical rates and cryptocurrency support "
"require paid plans.</p>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
